\f2\i \cf2 <$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>High Elvis! High Elvis! Praise the Dawkins!
\f1\i0  
\f2\i Bless the Holy Momma!\

\f1\i0 <$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91I propose we take a simple, immediate, actionable step towards regaining our dignity \'85\'92\

\f2\i <$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>High Elvis! Elvis! 
\f1\i0 the crowd chants.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91\'85 to channelling our undoubted charm and charisma \'85\'92
\f2\i \
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>High Elvis! Praise the Dawkins!\

\f1\i0 <$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91\'85 to saying no to all the Tom Parkers of this world \'85\'92
\f2\i \
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Tax the Tom Parkers! High Elvis! Tax the Tom Parkers! Praise the Dawkins!
\f1\i0 \
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91\'85 and to owning our talent. We are strong, and handsome, and beautiful, and virile. There\'92s is nothing we cannot do.\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>The crowd began losing the contents of their chitlins, or their shit, which ever you prefer.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91We will take our music to the rest of Ulyssia and on to the rest of the world!\'92\

\f2\i <$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>We\'92ll be famous! We\'92ll be richer than the Airborne!\

\f1\i0 <$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91My fellow Elvi, we must have self-respect, we must have dignity \'85\'92\

\f2\i <$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Self respect! Dignity!
\f1\i0 \
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91For the first time many decades we will revive communities, we will give people some pride and offer more than mere hope. Look around you, my fellow Elvi; the ground you stand upon is a rotting sludge of dirt, garbage and shit. We are all forced to live in this festering cesspool of filth and crime. We have been served up nothing but contempt, but we will rise above it all.\'92\

\f2\i <$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Filth and Crime! Filth and Crime! 
\f1\i0 \
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91With a single act, we can show the world we are no longer jokes, no longer just clones of a long-dead entertainer; we are serious.\'92\

\f2\i <$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Long live the long dead!\

\f1\i0 <$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91We will remove the filth; we will collect the rubbish; we will scrub the footpaths, hose down the streets, and shovel up the shit. We will clean up the Ghetto!\'92 the High Elvis proclaimed.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>The chanting ceased. A silent pall fell among the crowd. \
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91We are musicians, not street sweepers.\'92
